  abstract      = {This study scrutinizes the interplay within the AI, knowledge management, leadership and innovation, emphasizing the collaborative impact on the organizational performance. AI is essential within knowledge management., involving its contributions in improving innovation is important. Leadership involves the contribution in enabling the adaptation of technology and investing the innovation culture. The journals of 2019 to 2024 that have been retrieved from Emarald, Academia and Scopus, the research emphasizes the opportunities, appropriate practices and challenges in adopting AI-driven frameworks of knowledge management. The findings aim to derive the actionable insights by implementing strategies within the organizations for improving organizational learning, driving innovation and optimizing decisions.},
